 to). To save his family and his world\, Adam must join forces with his clo
 sest allies\, Teela (Camila Mendes) and Duncan/Man-At-Arms (Idris Elba)\, 
 and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the un
 iverse.\n\n***\n\n### 🗓️ **Event Details**\n\n📍 **Meetup Time:** 6
